Fix sidebar collapse reliability: write storage before workbench.startup()

Move VSCODE_COLLAPSE_SIDEBAR logic from client.ts (post-startup, racy) to
web.main.ts (pre-startup). The sidebar hidden state is read by LayoutStateModel
during workbench.startup() -> initLayout() -> initLayoutState(). By writing
workbench.sideBar.hidden = true into StorageScope.WORKSPACE before startup,
the layout system picks it up deterministically on every load -- including on
slow remote connections like Fargate where the old setPartHidden() call arrived
too late.

